  "name": "Crowdy waves",
  "author": "rory618",
  "description": "A particle system where ids are tracked in a grid, saving 4 ids per grid cell. Particles can interact with each other by reading the id of nearby particles which are stored in it's same grid cell. Mouse to interact and space to show data buffer.",
